# Cursor AI Rules

## Entry Points
- AGENTS.md - AI instructions
- llms.txt - Doc index
- docs/AGENTS.md - Subdirectory context
- docs/WORKFLOWS.md - Task steps

## Project Type
Documentation-only. No implementation code.

## Key Files
- docs/architecture-diagram.md - Mermaid diagrams
- docs/WORKFLOWS.md - Step-by-step tasks
- llms-full.txt - Complete context

## Style
- Concise, no filler
- Tables for mappings
- Include GitHub source links
- Mermaid for diagrams

## Architecture Fact
TUI → ThreadManager (direct)
NOT: TUI → MessageProcessor → ThreadManager

## Do Not
- Create implementation code
- Add dependencies
- Modify HTML directly
